  "image": "/images/posts/11150.webp",
  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La Municipalidad de Maullín invita a toda la comunidad a participar en la inauguración de las obras de mejoramiento del Gimnasio Municipal, recinto que fue renovado gracias a una inversión cercana a los $8 millones, en coordinación con el Instituto Nacional de Deportes (IND).</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Los trabajos incluyeron el pulido, reparación y pintado del piso deportivo, demarcación de la cancha y mejoras generales de pintura, permitiendo contar con un espacio renovado para el desarrollo del deporte comunal.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7e/1/16/1f4c5.png\"/> Miercoles 15 de julio</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🕑\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t29/1/16/1f551.png\"/> Desde las 14:00 horas</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📍\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t2d/1/16/1f4cd.png\"/> Gimnasio Municipal de Maullín</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🏀\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tb8/1/16/1f3c0.png\"/> Programa:</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Encuentros de Escuelas de Básquetbol.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> 15:00 horas: Ceremonia de inauguración.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Exhibición de talleres deportivos municipales.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Partidos de básquetbol categoría U16-U17 (selecciones comunales).</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Partido de fondo categoría adulta.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">¡Los invitamos a ser parte de esta gran jornada deportiva y a disfrutar de un recinto renovado para toda la comunidad!</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/maull%C3%ADn?__cft__[0]=AZYth4Ji6G8Rd31mENhXgdTIp3gQac7DWJfUHEnVfvsNDZeF5KCz6aw1trJla6k4dp8avkc4wBCFDi9_Gbus8uWNjJYb0cvygNfouJbiQYermGxbTI7n_gDs5MuAMFrhw4d0lSs4eCeiGY_1PYlniJgc&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#Maullín</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/deportemaull%C3%ADn?__cft__[0]=AZYth4Ji6G8Rd31mENhXgdTIp3gQac7DWJfUHEnVfvsNDZeF5KCz6aw1trJla6k4dp8avkc4wBCFDi9_Gbus8uWNjJYb0cvygNfouJbiQYermGxbTI7n_gDs5MuAMFrhw4d0lSs4eCeiGY_1PYlniJgc&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#DeporteMaullín</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/gimnasiomunicipal?__cft__[0]=AZYth4Ji6G8Rd31mENhXgdTIp3gQac7DWJfUHEnVfvsNDZeF5KCz6aw1trJla6k4dp8avkc4wBCFDi9_Gbus8uWNjJYb0cvygNfouJbiQYermGxbTI7n_gDs5MuAMFrhw4d0lSs4eCeiGY_1PYlniJgc&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#GimnasioMunicipal</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/b%C3%A1squetbol?__cft__[0]=AZYth4Ji6G8Rd31mENhXgdTIp3gQac7DWJfUHEnVfvsNDZeF5KCz6aw1trJla6k4dp8avkc4wBCFDi9_Gbus8uWNjJYb0cvygNfouJbiQYermGxbTI7n_gDs5MuAMFrhw4d0lSs4eCeiGY_1PYlniJgc&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#Básquetbol</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/vidasaludable?__cft__[0]=AZYth4Ji6G8Rd31mENhXgdTIp3gQac7DWJfUHEnVfvsNDZeF5KCz6aw1trJla6k4dp8avkc4wBCFDi9_Gbus8uWNjJYb0cvygNfouJbiQYermGxbTI7n_gDs5MuAMFrhw4d0lSs4eCeiGY_1PYlniJgc&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#VidaSaludable</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/seguimostrabajandojuntos?__cft__[0]=AZYth4Ji6G8Rd31mENhXgdTIp3gQac7DWJfUHEnVfvsNDZeF5KCz6aw1trJla6k4dp8avkc4wBCFDi9_Gbus8uWNjJYb0cvygNfouJbiQYermGxbTI7n_gDs5MuAMFrhw4d0lSs4eCeiGY_1PYlniJgc&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#SeguimosTrabajandoJuntos</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuernte munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11152\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/o2nglqn02mcc10i/gom_02_1024x768_8nhr8mhibl.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11153\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/bvzcz1sx3h6ldh1/gom_03_1024x768_sxhqa43rv0.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-b